<title>MEXICO: Mexico March department store sales rise 3.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico March department store sales rise 3.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's department store sales rose 3.7 percent in March compared to the same month a year earlier, the National Association of Self-Service and Department Stores (ANTAD) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The association also said that supermarket sales rose 1.1 percent compared to the same month a year earlier.  </p>
<p>The association said that sales of clothing and domestic appliances in department stores rose 7.1 percent and 1.5 percent in the month, respectively.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9553))</p>
